## ❌ What Is NOT Implemented (per Project Requirements)

### 1. Real Authentication System
> [!WARNING]
> **OTP is completely fake.** The code says literally: `"Demo mode: Enter any 4 digits to continue"`. No real SMS/OTP service is integrated. Anyone can sign up with any number.

- No backend user table / user accounts
- No real mobile OTP (no Twilio, MSG91, etc.)
- DOB is collected for login but validated only by comparing to localStorage — trivially bypassable
- **User sessions exist only in browser localStorage** — clearing browser data logs them out permanently

### 2. Stage-Differentiated Recommendations
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The project spec says **10th, 12th, and UG students should get completely different recommendations**. Currently:
> - All students go to the same Dashboard regardless of standard
> - The `/recommend` endpoint only filters by cutoff, category, branch, district — it does NOT differentiate by standard (10th vs 12th vs UG)
> - There is NO 10th-standard-specific content (Diploma, ITI, Group Selection guidance)
> - There is NO UG-specific content (PG recommendations, Research, Certification)

### 3. Parent Account — Multiple Child Profiles
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The spec says parents manage multiple child profiles, each isolated. Partially implemented:
> - ✅ UI allows creating multiple profiles (in Settings + Dashboard)
> - ✅ localStorage stores multiple profiles
> - ❌ Each profile's data is NOT isolated from the others at the recommendation level
> - ❌ Switching profiles does NOT send a different session_id to the backend
> - ❌ No backend awareness of parent vs child — all sessions are treated identically

### 4. AI Dashboard Update Prompt
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The spec says: *"When conversation indicates a change in interest, AI asks: 'Would you like to personalize your dashboard based on your recent conversations?' If Yes → dashboard updates."*
> - **This is completely missing.** The AI chat (`/assistant`) is totally disconnected from the dashboard.
> - Changing interest via chat → NOTHING happens to dashboard recommendations.

### 5. Reports Module
- The "Generate AI Report" button simulates a 2.5-second delay and shows "Report Generated Successfully!" but there is **no real report generated** — no PDF, no actual content is produced.
- The "Download Full PDF" button has no actual PDF download handler.

### 6. Careers, Exams, Scholarships — No Backend Personalization
- All three pages are 100% static hardcoded data.
- They do NOT read from the student's profile (community, standard, district) to filter relevant results.
- e.g., An SC student will see the exact same scholarship list as an OC student (no filtering by community).
- A 10th standard student sees the same exams as a 12th standard student.

### 7. Courses Page
- 100% static hardcoded data. Not connected to the backend `/college/*` courses at all.
- The "1,200+ courses" counter is fake — hardcoded string.

